//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// MOST COMMON BEGINNER ERRORS
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*

ERROR #1

scope = 2

Missing semicolon.

Correct:

scope = 2;



ERROR #2

Wrong:

class Item

Correct:

class Item
{
};



ERROR #3

Bad model path

model = "\item.p3d";

Correct:

model = "\MyMod\models\item.p3d";



ERROR #4

Missing parent class

Wrong:

class MyItem

Correct:

class Inventory_Base;

class MyItem : Inventory_Base



ERROR #5

Forgetting requiredAddons

Can cause startup crashes.

*/



